<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia buys 26,000 T soybean meal -trade.</title>
<headline>Tunisia buys 26,000 T soybean meal -trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia bought 13,000 tonnes of 44 percent soybean meal at $261.07 per tonne fob and 13,000 tonnes of 48 percent at $313 per tonne c&amp;f, traders said.  </p>
<p>The purchase was at a tender on Monday.</p>
<p>Shipment dates are January 29-February 6 for the 44 percent soybean meal and February 16-26 for the 48 percent.</p>
</text>
